00:06:38.264 --> 00:06:40.900
Can you speak to the significance of that,
given

00:06:41.601 --> 00:06:43.836
the rising influence of China
in the region?

00:06:43.870 --> 00:06:46.506
Yeah, a big win for the administration
diplomatically.

00:06:46.506 --> 00:06:49.742
Papua New Guinea is a location right
north of Australia.

00:06:49.742 --> 00:06:53.546
That provides tremendous place
for the Navy to project power

00:06:53.546 --> 00:06:54.480
from naval assets.

00:06:54.480 --> 00:06:57.683
We saw the Chinese make deals
with the Solomon Island countries

00:06:57.683 --> 00:06:59.552
before there's going to be
this pivot to the Pacific

00:06:59.552 --> 00:07:01.254
that's finally now taking place.

00:07:01.254 --> 00:07:03.356
I think it's very important
that this administration

00:07:03.356 --> 00:07:05.191
did that very big win
for the administration.

00:07:05.191 --> 00:07:06.592
Thank you, my clients.

